  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000r39a](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000r39a) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 63.882 depth occurred on Aug 23 2025 81 km ENE of Severo-Kuril’sk, Russia. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 50.8695 longitude 157.2411. It impacted 92 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
